==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 0.67~6.67 seconds<sup>20f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~16 seconds<sup>200f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2.67~6.67 seconds<sup>80f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*4 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The Teacher Bun Bun here is as strong as the one first seen in Empire of Cats Chapter 3 Moon so you can use a similar strategy to one that would work there. What separates these two stages is the Shy Boy rush at the start so make sure to bring Anti-Red and Anti-Floating units to make sure they don't mark your demise.

